      "content": "i get that you're supposed to say that, but it feels so clinical. like you're trying to fix a mistake instead of just listening to what i'm actually saying. there's a certain peace in the idea of just... letting go. of not having to fight to exist anymore. why is wanting that silence so wrong?",
